  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v8.1.0: Adds request-based retrievers, keyword search, configurable normalized weighted RRF, optional PIXIE integration and answer processing-speed forwarding. Strengthens document identity, chunk/vector validation, embedding response ordering and dimension handling, empty document replacement, URL decoding/cancellation and splitter correctness. Preserves RAG message attachments and tool continuations and isolates rewriting/reranking. Existing records are not automatically migrated or repaired; follow the release notes for scoped cleanup or reindexing. Full notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/rag/Mythosia.AI.Rag/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v810",
